  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1750036978_7883358_77c6e2e407f72575734c5f8c762b7446.png",
  "description": "<div data-core-is=\"block\">\r\n<div data-stopdrag=\"true\">\r\n<h3>We Are&nbsp;Saledress</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-core-is=\"block\">\r\n<div data-stopdrag=\"\">\r\n<div>Established in 2018, goes beyond simply offering customers high-quality fashion and accessories at wholesale prices. Also strives to empower fashion retailers, helping them enhance their businesses and attain greater success.</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div data-core-is=\"block\">\r\n<div data-stopdrag=\"true\">\r\n<h3>Retail &amp; Wholesale is&nbsp;All in One</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-core-is=\"block\">\r\n<div data-stopdrag=\"\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>We have collaborated with over 5,000 Amazon sellers and served more than 4,200 boutique owners.&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div><strong>SD-AMZ</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Bulk Sale Box (BSB)</strong>, with&nbsp;two distinctive sections,&nbsp;we cater to a wide range of customers, offering discounted prices and bulk purchases sourced from cooperative Amazon sellers.&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>By seamlessly integrating retail and wholesale, SALEDRESS provides a unique shopping experience where convenience, style, and savings converge.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
